<title>UK: TENNIS-STATISTICS OF SAMPRAS V PIOLINE FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STATISTICS OF SAMPRAS V PIOLINE FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics from the men's final</p>
<p>between Pete Sampras (U.S.) and Cedric Pioline (France) at</p>
<p>Wimbledon on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sampras won 6-4 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Time: One hour 34 minutes</p>
<p>				    Sampras   Pioline    </p>
<p>Aces				  17	 13</p>
<p>Double faults			2	  1</p>
<p>Percentage first serves in    59	 59</p>
<p>Forehand winners		   5	  2</p>
<p>Backhand winners		   7	  6</p>
<p>Volley winners		     8	  7</p>
<p>Passing winners		    4	  4</p>
<p>Return winners		     6	  3</p>
<p>Percentage returns in	   60	 39</p>
<p>Break points			 8	  1</p>
<p>Break points won		   4	  0</p>
</text>
